{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act46side_level_act46side_03_end","storyGroup":"act46side","storySort":7,"storyDependence":"act46side_level_act46side_03_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"OS-3","storyName":"雪灌木中","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"小猎手茱安娜将恩雅带回家疗伤，发现了她的圣女身份，反而对她有所疏远。阿克托斯怀疑刺杀是布朗陶家所为，三族关系再次僵化。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act46side/level_act46side_03_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act46side_03","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":5,"next":7,"characters":["恩雅","小猎手","茱安娜","角峰","古罗","菈塔托丝","阿克托斯","恩希欧迪斯","锏"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_bg_24_g5_guestroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_saferoom_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$2","duration":"0.7","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"这里是......","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小猎手","text":"我家。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小猎手","text":"最后看到的那些人走了相反的方向，这里很安全。等处理完你的伤口，你就立马离开。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"......谢谢，我——","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","action":"shake","random":"true","power":"5","times":"30","duration":"0.5","id":23},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小猎手","text":"少说话，也别乱动，希瓦艾什。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小猎手","text":"......","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#10$2","focus":"l","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小猎手","text":"外衣还算厚，距离又远，伤口不是很深。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小猎手","text":"......不过他们用的箭有一个小倒钩，拔的时候会很疼，我尽量稳着来。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":31},{"type":"charslot","id":32},{"type":"text","text":"年轻的猎手将箭杆折断一截，她捏紧剩余的部分，目光瞟向伤者，而对方只是轻轻点头，没有流露出一丝恐慌。","id":33},{"type":"text","text":"猎手深深呼吸，缓缓地拔出箭镞，倒钩牵动肉体的触感让她也不禁冷汗直流。","id":34},{"type":"text","text":"她竭尽全力地让双手稳定，直至箭镞完全从对方的身上分离。","id":35},{"type":"dialog","id":36},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#7$2","focus":"l","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小猎手","text":"呼——呼——总算......","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"非常......感谢......","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小猎手","text":"还没弄好，你再忍忍。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":44},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothtrailground","volume":"1","id":45},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":46},{"type":"text","text":"紧接着她从腰包里掏出一包药粉，挽起恩雅的裙摆，熟练地抹匀在她的伤口上，又拿出一根布条将那里紧紧包扎起来。","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小猎手","text":"你疼的话可以叫出来，我不会笑话你。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"我不想让你更加紧张。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"万一手抖了，我自己也不好受。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小猎手","text":"嘁。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#5$2","focus":"l","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小猎手","text":"......嗯？","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#5$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1.5","isCopy":"true","id":59},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":60},{"type":"text","text":"一只雪白的小云兽从猎手的兜帽中探出细长的身体，双爪扒着猎手的发辫，湿润的鼻头在恩雅的毛领边微微颤动。","id":61},{"type":"text","text":"随后，它伸着脑袋嗅闻着陌生人的气味。","id":62},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","focus":"l","isCopy":"true","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小猎手","text":"别碰它，它很讨厌生人。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","focus":"n","isCopy":"true","id":66},{"type":"text","text":"不等猎手说完，恩雅的手指已经轻轻揉上了小云兽的下巴。仅仅是抚摸到它柔软的皮毛，仿佛内心在严寒下也能升起一丝暖意。","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#8$1","focus":"l","isCopy":"true","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小猎手","text":"（压低声音）裂云兽，快回去......","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"这个小家伙......叫“裂云兽”吗？","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"不过，我还不知道你的名字呢，我的救星大人。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#4$1","focus":"l","isCopy":"true","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小猎手","text":"......","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8b/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","focus":"l","isCopy":"true","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小猎手","text":"茱安娜。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"我可不想知道你叫什么，希瓦艾什。你最好别以为我是你的朋友。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"为什么？你对我很好啊。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#8$1","focus":"l","isCopy":"true","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"那你们又是怎么对我的！","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","focus":"l","isCopy":"true","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"哼......跟你也没关系，不说了。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"“你们”的意思，是指希瓦艾什家吗？","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"或者，你在说恩希欧迪斯......","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#8$1","focus":"l","isCopy":"true","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"不止他一个。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"我父亲说，从恩希欧迪斯的父亲开始，希瓦艾什就痴迷于亵渎耶拉冈德。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"他把沥青浇淋在耶拉冈德的脊骨，把毒水倾倒在耶拉冈德的尾巴，他的贪婪也为自己带来了毁灭。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"......","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#8$1","focus":"l","isCopy":"true","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"结果现在，这个恩希欧迪斯压根没有吸取教训，他变本加厉地搅扰耶拉冈德的安宁。","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"但他最重的罪孽，是他竟敢在耶拉冈德的血肉上开了个大洞。这一次的灾祸，不就是希瓦艾什惹怒了耶拉冈德的证明？","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"可是......谢拉格人不可能永远困在雪山。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"工业和商业不是真的让我们过上更好的生活了吗？慈悲的耶拉冈德怎么会因为我们过上了好日子而惩罚我们呢？","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#8$1","focus":"l","isCopy":"true","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"更好的生活？","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"你们希瓦艾什能有这副鬼样，天天躲在温暖的壁炉边吃香喝辣......","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#8$1","focus":"l","isCopy":"true","id":102},{"type":"multiline","name":"茱安娜","text":"靠的......","id":103},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#6$1","focus":"l","isCopy":"true","id":104},{"type":"multiline","name":"茱安娜","text":"就是把我们变成代价！","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#11$1","focus":"l","isCopy":"true","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"在我小时候，雪山脚下还栖息着许多兽群。","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"它们以山川为给养，到溪流边饮用清水，回山林里啃食草木与浆果，如此度过千年，从未改变。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"但是喀兰贸易却把铁轨一路修到这里，硬生生把山川分割开来，逼着野兽冒死来回跨过铁轨才能生存。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#8$1","focus":"l","isCopy":"true","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"偶尔列车撞死了它们，你们竟还抱怨是它们不长眼睛。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"兽群们只能往更高的地方迁居，可山上的土地根本不够养活数量那么庞大的族群，它们互相争斗、撕咬，能活下来的越来越少。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"更别说还有许多对列车噪音敏感的云兽......这其中有多少生灵逝去，我又是怎么收养到了裂云兽，你根本不会明白！","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"......可是，山脚下的农民们，需要那些列车送来的肥料与种子，山上的病人，也需要那些药物。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#8$1","focus":"l","isCopy":"true","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"那耶拉冈德赐予我们的富足的猎获又在哪里呢？","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"每年我们打到的猎物，都比过去一年更少，连泉水也不再像以往那么清甜。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"我们家族遵循着耶拉冈德神圣的教诲，世世代代在山上以狩猎谋生，为此还会雕刻圣像以表敬爱。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#11$1","focus":"l","isCopy":"true","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"父亲......还有我，甚至弟弟妹妹，也向来虔心祈祷，不敢对耶拉冈德轻慢一次。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#6$1","focus":"l","isCopy":"true","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"凭什么成为“代价”的是我们？！","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":124},{"type":"charslot","id":125},{"type":"text","text":"突然的喊声让裂云兽有些惊怕，它从浑身发抖的茱安娜身上跃下，徘徊在恩雅的脚边。","id":126},{"type":"text","text":"恩雅俯身抱起裂云兽，将它送回茱安娜的肩上。","id":127},{"type":"dialog","id":128},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":129},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"......别再这么乱动了，伤口容易崩开。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"其实......你说的这些，我都是第一次听到。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"我知道你想反驳什么，尽管说吧，希瓦艾什。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"不，我不想反驳。","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"我......有些不同，很多时候必须要待在屋子里，仅从别人的口中了解现在的谢拉格。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"即使有些日子，我能走出常住的地方，亲身体会谢拉格的一切，也远远不够。","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"耶拉冈德不会放弃每一个谢拉格子民，我向你保证。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1d/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"哼......","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"你还是先保证自己能平安渡过眼前的危难吧......","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"话又说回来，那些土匪是怎么回事？山上的几家猎户我基本都认识，刚才的人里可没有熟面孔。","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"他们......或许是为我而来的。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"为你？你有什么仇人吗？","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"......呣，说来话长了。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"如果是这样，你今天最好就别走了，他们肯定不会放弃。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"我父亲的朋友在城里开杂货铺，弟弟妹妹这几天也在他那里帮忙，我这就下山去找他多拿些药膏和箭头。","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"还能喊些熟人上来一起对付那帮土匪。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"......","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"绝对不行。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"你一个人害怕吗？我脚程很快，精力也很好，现在下山的话明早就能回来。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"我不是担心这个......","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"为什么？你们希瓦艾什真是麻烦，支支吾吾半天都说不清楚。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"你要是不能战斗，说什么我都得去城里找帮手，就这么定了。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.7","focus":"l","id":168},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":169},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2010_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"等等，我可以告诉你——","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3d/Avg_avg_npc_2010_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":172},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_chairbump","volume":"0.7","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.7","id":174},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":175},{"type":"charslot","id":176},{"type":"text","text":"恩雅急切地起身，伸手拉住了正准备离开的猎手的袖角，自己身着的斗篷也随激烈的动作落下。","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"......！","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"圣女......大人......？","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"其实......我......","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"对不起！！","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"茱安娜","text":"我刚刚顶撞了圣女大人！请您惩罚我吧！","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_4211_snhunt_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"不......我怎么会惩罚你......","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"你先别着急，先坐下......","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4211_snhunt_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":190},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":191},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","id":192},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":193},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":194},{"type":"text","text":"恩雅想要拉住小猎手，小猎手却迅速后撤一步，拉开和恩雅的距离。","id":195},{"type":"text","text":"她转身要走，突然又仿佛想起了什么，转过身对着恩雅恭恭敬敬地行了一礼，这才离开了房间。","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_174_slbell_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩雅","text":"唉......","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_174_slbell_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":199},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":200},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":201},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":202},{"type":"charslot","id":203},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_bg_bg_vipward.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":204},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":205},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loading_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_sys_loading_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":206,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":207},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":208},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"古罗将军......","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_260_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古罗","text":"哦，原来是耶克家的小子，*谢拉格俚语*，进来之前都不敲个门。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_260_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古罗","text":"你怎么来了？","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_260_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"我陪恩希亚小姐来做检查，她早上也遇上了车祸，好在没受什么伤。","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"结果听说你也在这里，顺便来探望——你还好吗？","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_260_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":218},{"type":"multiline","name":"古罗","text":"哼，我身上这点小伤随便挨挨也无妨，但是——","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_260_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":220},{"type":"multiline","name":"古罗","text":"等等，你说你们家二小姐怎么样了？","id":221},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"很不巧，恩希亚小姐她早上替老爷送东西，去蔓珠院的山路上撞上了对向车道的车，要不是锏小姐到得及时，差一点就要酿成大祸。","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_260_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古罗","text":"你是说她也要去蔓珠院？","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_260_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古罗","text":"怪了，我家老爷也是今早突然收到了蔓珠院的通知，说是要早上提前去开会，结果就在山路上碰上了落石。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_260_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古罗","text":"......那你有听说，布朗陶家出了什么事吗？","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_260_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"不......暂时还没有听说。布朗陶家怎么了吗？","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_260_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古罗","text":"怪不得......怪不得刚才老爷走的时候气势汹汹的，好久没见他发这么大火。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_260_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_260_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古罗","text":"可是这搞的——唉！","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9b/Avg_avg_npc_260_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_260_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古罗","text":"马特洪兄弟，请你一定要帮这忙。能不能麻烦请你家老爷，现在就带人去布朗陶家？","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_260_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古罗","text":"我家大人比我还冲动，就怕这个时候会做傻事，或许只有恩希欧迪斯老爷能拦住他了。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_260_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_199_yak_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"角峰","text":"好......我这就安排。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_avg_199_yak_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":239},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":240},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":241},{"type":"charslot","id":242},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_bg_24_g8_nobleroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#7$1","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_254_1#7$1","id":245},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":246},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":247},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"......阿克托斯，在你进一步发疯前，我真诚地建议你先到医院做个全面的检查，轻度脑震荡的症状并不明显，最容易被人所忽略。","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_254_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"不要转移话题！","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_254_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":253},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"正面回答我，为什么只有我和希瓦艾什遭受到了袭击，而你们几个布朗陶却安安心心地躲在家里，你到底知道些什么？！","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"我对今天发生的事了解的一切信息，全部都来源于你。","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_254_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"还想狡辩？","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"联系希瓦艾什家的时候，那边的佣人都知道要关心我几句，还告诉我恩希亚也被骗走的消息。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"而你呢？从始至终都是这一副若无其事的样子！好像这种事发生了也没什么可稀奇的，这就是布朗陶家的态度？","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"我为我的态度向你致歉。这些天所有谢拉格人都过得很艰难，希望能得到你的谅解。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_254_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"收起这副惺惺作态的样子，我受够了。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"大家都说，如今的布朗陶家出了个妖妇。","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"以前我从没把这句话当回事，只要你的所作所为是为了谢拉格和耶拉冈德，无论做什么我都不在乎。","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"可现在呢？","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"菈塔托丝，耶拉冈德什么时候教了你这套暗算盟友的阴险做派？","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"注意你的措辞，阿克托斯。即使你试图讽刺和激怒我，言语里也不能对耶拉冈德不敬。","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_254_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"不要避开重点。现在是我在问你，直接回答我的问题！","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"我和恩希亚被人袭击的事，布朗陶家到底有没有参与？","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"你在浪费时间，我重复了很多次：我对此毫不知情，并深表遗憾。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_254_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"如果这就是你的最终答复，那就别怪我把事情做绝了。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"什么意思？","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_254_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"别以为你们弄伤了古罗，佩尔罗契家就无人可用了。我出门前就已经安排了手下，让他们准时来到这里“接应”。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"布朗陶家必须被彻底搜查。尽管我也不想走到这一步，但现在看来，不得不委屈一下休露丝和她的孩子了。","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_253_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"你敢？！","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_254_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"是你逼我的，菈塔托丝！","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":288},{"type":"charslot","id":289},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_dooropen","volume":"0.6","id":290},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":291},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_swordexsheath","volume":"1","id":292},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_attack_ready","volume":"0.8","delay":"0.5","id":293},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":294},{"type":"text","text":"客厅的大门毫无征兆地被打开了。在开门声传来的刹那，阿克托斯毫不犹豫地拔出佩刀。","id":295},{"type":"text","text":"眼尖的布朗陶家护卫们也旋即举起武器，挡在菈塔托丝的身前。","id":296},{"type":"dialog","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":298},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":299},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"......","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"想必，大家已经讨论过今天发生的事件了。","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"我同样为这件事而来，并且已有一些结论，还请二位不用如此紧张。","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":304},{"type":"charslot","id":305},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_unsheathe","volume":"0.6","id":306},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":307},{"type":"text","text":"看到阿克托斯先收起了佩刀，菈塔托丝对着护卫们轻轻挥手，众人才缓缓退开。","id":308},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"你来的正好，恩希欧迪斯。","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"我代表佩尔罗契，你代表希瓦艾什，一同要求彻查布朗陶家的全部文件，相关布朗陶家族成员也得配合我们的询问。","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"抱歉，阿克托斯，我并不这么想。","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"什么？","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"倘若菈塔托丝希望除掉你我，那么她的动机是什么？","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"在这个节点，用暗杀的方式处理另外两家的家主，只会引起更大的骚乱。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"佩尔罗契家拥有最庞大的士兵队伍，希瓦艾什家维系喀兰贸易的运转。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"即使你我同时意外身故，菈塔托丝不仅不可能控制谢拉格的局面，反而会面临猛烈的报复。","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"我说得对吗？","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":323},{"type":"charslot","id":324},{"type":"text","text":"菈塔托丝避开恩希欧迪斯的注视，只是微微颔首。","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"那这也不能解释，为什么就布朗陶家没有被袭击。","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"也许只是巧合或者时机不对，袭击者是否安排了针对布朗陶家的行动我们也不得而知。","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":330},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"光是“巧合”可说服不了我，恩希欧迪斯。","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"如果不是菈塔托丝，那究竟是什么人会做出这种事情来？","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"这件事的真相不是短时间内就可以得出的。","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"别忘了，如今谢拉格泥沙俱下，想要趁乱分一杯羹的绝不在少数。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"在维多利亚送来援助的时间点上，行刺杀之举，显然对方觉得不能让我们继续这么合作下去。","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"是维多利亚人干的？","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"不止他们，在此刻介入谢拉格事宜的外国政客都脱不了嫌疑。","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"所以我希望能维持上一次会议最后的结论——由我来负责包括维多利亚在内的所有对外事务。","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"我一定会查明真相，为了佩尔罗契，为了三族的和平......也为了恩希亚。","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"......","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"我最后信你一次......","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3c/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"哼......","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_254_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"不要得意，菈塔托丝。看在恩希欧迪斯和休露丝的分上，今天算你走运！","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿克托斯","text":"要是发现确实是你在背后搞鬼，我绝不饶你！","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_avg_npc_254_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":353},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_smashtable","volume":"1","id":354},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":355},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":356},{"type":"text","text":"这位健壮的乌萨斯一拍桌子，猛地转身离去。","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"......恩希欧迪斯，你能为我平息那个疯子的怒火，我很感激。","id":359,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"不过我已经很累了，相信你也明白，应对无端的指责有多么令人疲惫。","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"如果你对我有所怀疑，希望从我这里问出些什么，我——","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"不必多说，我理解。如今三族之间的信任比什么都重要。","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"我还有要紧的事务需要处理，就不继续打扰了。","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"......不送。","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":367},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":368},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":369},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":370},{"type":"charslot","id":371},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_bg_67_G4_kjeragstreet.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":372},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":373},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":374,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":375},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":376},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#11$1","duration":"1","id":377},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#9$1","duration":"1","id":378},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"可以放心了，恩希亚没事。","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"他们原本是冲着我来的。","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"很显然。我检查过现场，大概率是人为制造的车祸。他们应该是盯上了你的车子，但是不知道车里坐的是谁。","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"这不对劲......手段太过激了，但是背后的人，简直就像在明说，他们根本不惮于使用这种过激手段。","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"......他们的主要目的，是引发混乱与猜忌，行为比结果更加重要。","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"另一方面，如果说还有什么可能......我或者恩希亚，以及阿克托斯，都不是他们的真正目标。","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"......雪山上有麻烦了。","id":391,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"......他们冲着恩雅去的？","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"如果这时候圣女出了什么意外，更是坐实了那些阴谋论谣言，谢拉格将会深陷泥泞。","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"锏，我需要你保护恩雅。","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"......","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"恩雅已经出发很久了，我不能向你许下任何承诺。","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"你要做最坏的打算，恩希欧迪斯。","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"......","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"我相信恩雅。","id":404,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"你用了“相信”这个词。","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"不像往常那样，多多分析些理由，好让我更有信心吗？","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"是的。","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"我相信。","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5f/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":412},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":413},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":414},{"type":"charslot","id":415},{"type":"image","id":416}],"characters":["恩雅","小猎手","茱安娜","角峰","古罗","菈塔托丝","阿克托斯","恩希欧迪斯","锏"]}